essbook><name>SATO, NAOKI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SATO KOICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SATO NAOKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SATO, KOICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SATO, NAOKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A level indicator (1), provided with a contact or conductor electrode that hardly deteriorates, comprises a moving member consisting of a float (9) and an arm (10) which follow the liquid surface in a fuel tank (2), a contact (7) fitted on a slider (8) which synchronizes with the motion of the moving member, and an insulating substrate (6) provided with a conductor electrode (4) on which the contact (7) slides. The contact (7) is formed from an alloy, which does not contain silver.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Indicateur de niveau (1) pourvu d'un contact ou d'une électrode conductrice à détérioration limitée, et comprenant un élément mobile constitué par un flotteur (9) et par un bras (10) qui suit la surface du liquide d'un réservoir de carburant (2), un contact (7) placé sur une glissière (8) synchronisé avec le déplacement de l'élément mobile et un substrat isolant (6) comportant une électrode conductrice (4) sur laquelle glisse le contact (7). Ce contact (7) est constitué par un alliage ne contenant pas d'argent.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright law